WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.328
How do you teach heritage so students remember it,

00:00:02.328 --> 00:00:03.806
without losing a whole evening to lesson prep?

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:07.886
DiViet helps teachers build lessons and tests

00:00:07.886 --> 00:00:08.938
on Vietnam's heritage,

00:00:08.938 --> 00:00:10.572
matched to each student's school level.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:13.595
School admins create teacher accounts.

00:00:13.595 --> 00:00:15.146
Teachers create classes and add students,

00:00:15.146 --> 00:00:16.712
and every student gets their own account.

00:00:18.367 --> 00:00:20.453
Each student has a student code and a temporary password.

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:21.635
Teachers print login slips

00:00:21.635 --> 00:00:22.485
and hand them out to the class.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:26.420
Just pick a heritage site from the library,

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:28.035
and AI drafts a lesson at the class's level.

00:00:28.035 --> 00:00:29.280
Teachers read it, edit it,

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:30.838
and decide when to publish.

00:00:33.633 --> 00:00:35.164
The question bank has eight question types,

00:00:35.164 --> 00:00:36.994
sorted by level. AI-written questions need a teacher's

00:00:36.994 --> 00:00:38.023
approval before use.

00:00:42.367 --> 00:00:44.094
Each published lesson gets a lesson code.

00:00:44.094 --> 00:00:45.716
Students enter the code to open the lesson.

00:00:48.467 --> 00:00:49.321
Each level learns its own way:

00:00:49.321 --> 00:00:51.005
primary students hear stories, play and earn stars;

00:00:51.005 --> 00:00:52.697
lower secondary gets scores and an explanation for each question;

00:00:52.697 --> 00:00:54.478
upper secondary reads sources and sees analysis by

00:00:54.478 --> 00:00:54.784
topic.

00:00:57.633 --> 00:00:59.650
After a test, teachers see each student's score,

00:00:59.650 --> 00:01:01.368
the class's mastery of each heritage site,

00:01:01.368 --> 00:01:02.752
and suggestions on what to review.

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:08.872
Students learn on the web or the Android app.

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:13.450
Schools start on the Free plan.

00:01:13.450 --> 00:01:15.201
Send your details on the For schools page,

00:01:15.201 --> 00:01:16.546
and the DiViet team will get back to you.

00:01:19.933 --> 00:01:21.593
DiViet. Discover Vietnam's heritage.
